OL,5,G1800 Inside the Ambulance
OL,6,     FOn shift with the West Midlands
OL,7,     FAmbulance Service. This episode
OL,8,     Ffeatures a pensioner who has
OL,9,     Fsuffered a domestic assault and a
OL,10,     Ftoddler who has had a fit.
OL,11,G1900 Inside the Ambulance
OL,12,     FOn shift with the paramedics from
OL,13,     Fthe West Midlands Ambulance
OL,14,     FService. The team help a woman who
OL,15,     Fhas had a violent seizure and a
OL,16,     Fcarer who has crashed her bicycle.
OL,17,G2000 Inside the Operating Theatre
